   "firstAppearance": "s1",
   "summary": "First mention: “There were three of us, classmates and friends--Terry O.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "jeff",
   "name": "Jeff",
   "role": "major",
   "firstAppearance": "s1",
   "summary": "First mention: “Terry was strong on facts--geography and meteorology and those; Jeff could beat him any time on biology, and I didn’t care what it was they talked about, so long as it connected with human life, somehow.”"
  },
  {
   "id": "ellador",
   "name": "Ellador",
   "role": "major",
   "firstAppearance": "s2",
   "summary": "First mention: ““Celis,” she said distinctly, pointing to the one in blue; “Alima”--the one in rose; then, with a vivid imitation of Terry’s impressive manner, she laid a firm delicate hand on her gold-green jerkin--“Ellador.”"
  },
